    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Valmir!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Tactical Collectible Card Game where wit and strategy are the keys to victory. Choose your Faction and build the ultimate deck to crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Combat Skills, empower your units with Items, gain the upper hand with Racial Spells, or dominate the battlefield with Legendary Units. Every match will be unique and unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your decks in the Training Grounds, uncover each faction\u2019s story in Campaign mode, battle dangerous random foes in Skirmish mode, or challenge other players in Online Multiplayer mode. Each victory earns you resources to unlock new cards, either through Card Packs or by crafting them in the Forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valmir is based on the novel of the same name by Alejandro Ramos Mart\u00edn. By playing this game, you\u2019ll be immersed in the conflicts between the various factions and discover their stories through rich narrative passages and captivating hand-painted illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, an indie card game made by card players, for card players!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Valmir!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new Tactical Collectible Card Game where wit and strategy are the keys to victory. Choose your Faction and build the ultimate deck to crush your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine Combat Skills, empower your units with Items, gain the upper hand with Racial Spells, or dominate the battlefield with Legendary Units. Every match will be unique and unforgettable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your decks in the Training Grounds, uncover each faction\u2019s story in Campaign mode, battle dangerous random foes in Skirmish mode, or challenge other players in Online Multiplayer mode. Each victory earns you resources to unlock new cards, either through Card Packs or by crafting them in the Forge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valmir is based on the novel of the same name by Alejandro Ramos Mart\u00edn. By playing this game, you\u2019ll be immersed in the conflicts between the various factions and discover their stories through rich narrative passages and captivating hand-painted illustrations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, an indie card game made by card players, for card players!</p>",
    "short_description": "The Tactical Collectible Card Game set in the narrative world of Valmir, where strategy and positioning are the keys to victory.",
